'''Bruno''' is a young orphan with blonde hair and a plump build who lived at the [[Rotterdam Orphanage]] with [[Den]] and [[Harrison Fears]]. He was recruited by [[Tantras]] and became a member of the [[Blood Spiral]].

== History ==
Bruno would regularly bully [[Harrison Fears]] with [[Dirk]] and the other orphans, which often resulted in fights with [[Den Fears]], who fought to protect his little brother and the other weaker kids at the orphanage. {{source|Den vs Harrison}}

When [[Tantras]] and the [[Blood Spiral]] came to the orphanage in search of recruits, Bruno and [[Dirk]] were both given the Titan [[Harlekin]]. After being ordained with the mark of the Spiral by [[Rassimov]], the orphans were sent to ambush [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]]. They were forced to retreat however when [[Dante Vale]] arrived to back up his team. {{source|Den vs Harrison}} 

Despite joining the Blood Spiral, Bruno was the only orphan from the Rotterdam orphanage who was not selected to be tutored by Tantras. {{source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}

== Personality ==
Like the other orphans, Bruno was a cowardly bully who constantly tormented Harrison at any opportunity. However, his cowardice was exposed when he came face to with the [[Fog Monster]]s, hiding behind his [[Harlekin]] Titan. {{source|S2E33}} It is likely due to his cowardice that he was the only orphan, excluding Den, not to be chosen as one of the students taught by [[Tantras]]. {{source|S2E36}}

== Abilities ==
This orphan was a thug who picked on those weaker than him. He was, however, able to use basic powers as taught to him by [[Tantras]]. {{source|Den vs Harrison}}
